SUMMARY:Lunch at the Local Table
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\nWe will meet at ***The Local Table for a la
 te lunch.***\n1307 7th Ave E\, H’vlle\n**Daily – 8 am – 3 pm. (Wed t
 hru Sunday)**\n**A limit of 8 ppl are welcome to join me.**\nPlease keep y
 our RSVP’s current.\nWE WILL MEET INSIDE AND find a table.\nFeeding comm
 unity in the heart of Hendersonville NC\, our eatery is an extension of ou
 r family urban farm\, Stump Farms.\nhttps://www.facebook.com/people/The-Lo
