SUMMARY:Blue Ridge Pkwy Fall Color Tour
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\n**the Curmudgeon’s Annual Fall Color Seri
 es.**\nI am going to Tour the Fall Color on the BRPkwy. For those who are 
 new to the area\, **this one is the reason you moved here.**\nWe will star
 t from the Maggie Valley entrance and return on the BRPkwy – stopping at
  select overlooks. The Mile-High Overlook & Waterrock Knob are included. 
 ‘Trail breaks’ available at the beginning & during (2ea) the tour.\n**
 Rain Date: Fri 16-Oct-'26\; 9:15 AM**\nDifficulty: No hiking involved!. BR
 ING drink\; snacks\, camera\, binoculars. I don’t plan on ‘lunch break
 s’\, but ‘da vimen’ often out-vote me (smirk).\n**Carpool contributi
 ons appreciated. $10.00 suggested**\n**Drive time: 5.5 hrs - All Day !!! /
  150 mi RT.**\n**Return Not earlier than: 3:30pm**\n**Dogs:** since we wil
 l be in the car all day\, it’s probably best to leave Fluffy at home.\nW
 AITLISTED PEOPLE WILL BE ADDED AS DRIVERS SIGN ON.\nI currently have 2 dri
 ver(s) (=8ppl).\nFor those who wish to drive on their own (or different da
 y)\, contact me for full options and directions: gordie Any day during the
  2nd & 3rd week of Oct is best view times. Avoid weekend traffic!!\n..All 
 events are at your own risk. You are responsible for your OWN safety and a
 dequate equipment.\nWaiver: The organizer of this event is a volunteer and
  not a professional guide. The function of the organizer is only to organi
 ze this event. There are certain risks inherent in any outdoor activity. E
 ach participant\, by signing up to attend this event\, agrees to release f
 rom liability the leader(s)\, Hendo Fun Friends\, its Partners\, Affiliate
 s\, and members for any accident\, injury\, illness\, or personal loss whi
 ch might occur while participating in this activity or while traveling in 
 any vehicle during this trip. Each participant further agrees to abide by 
 the rules and regulations concerning safety\, to follow instructions of th
 e leader(s)\, and not to become intentionally separated from the group. Th
 e leader(s) also has the right to use any images collected on this trip fo
 r recording on website photo collections.\ngordie's contact: CurmudgeonHik
 er@gmail.com\n(before day of event): 828.393.0297 (text only)\nPics: https
 ://www.flickr.com/photos/146993931@N05/albums
