SUMMARY:Open Studio Tour 2026
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\n***Open Studio Tour 2026***\n**October 16 t
 hru 18th\; 10a - 4p**\nFor one weekend\, visitors will have the opportunit
 y to meet artists where they create\, see works in progress\, learn about 
 different creative processes\, and discover original artwork and handmade 
 pieces throughout the region. While the tour is rooted in Henderson County
 \, some participating artists have studios just beyond the county line.\nM
 any participating artists will have artwork and handmade pieces available 
 for purchase\, making the weekend a great opportunity to find something un
 ique while supporting local creatives.\n**Maps of the various studios will
  be available online at a later date at:**\nhttps://www.studio116nc.com/st
 udiotour\nstudio116\; 116 W. Blue Ridge Rd\; East Flat Rock\, NC 28726
