SUMMARY:Music of the 50's to 70's
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\nJ&M Farms now known as Sissy's Farm is back
  open. Hope to see you there! There will be cake for a friends 80th b'day.
 \n\nCome sing along with music from the 50's-70's.\n\nThey have beer\, win
 e\, cider and a variety of other drinks. There's a food truck on site. The
 ir store offers local products\, cheese\, jam. Hand made crafts. They're v
 ery reasonably priced and it's a cozy spot to come hang out with friends.\
 n\nHope to see you here the third Friday of each month.
